#: ../../tools/gencc_tools.rst:32 737d9aaadf8c45cfbda8887e83f0c047
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get summary statistics of gene-disease validity "
"classifications from GenCC. Returns counts per classification level "
"(Definitive, Strong, Moderate, Limited, etc.). Optionally filter by "
"gene\\_symbol (e.g., 'GBA'), disease name substring, or submitter "
"organization. Without filters, returns global stats across all 40,000+ "
"curated submissions."
